### 메시지 전송
POST {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "안녕하세요",
  "attachments": [
    {
      "objectKey": "profiles/1/sample.png",
      "fileName": "회의록.pdf"
    }
  ],
  "threadId": 1
}

### 메시지 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/messages?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 메시지 수정
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/messages/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "안녕하세요"
}

### 메시지 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/messages/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 첨부파일 업로드 URL 발급
POST {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/files/presigned-url
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileName": "회의록.pdf",
  "contentType": "image/png",
  "fileSize": 102400
}

### 첨부파일 업로드 확인
POST {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/files/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "objectKey": "profiles/1/sample.png"
}

### 파일 공유 채널 파일 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/files?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
